{"id":"A1-L094","title":"Object pronouns: production and review","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U06","focus":"Object pronouns — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Object pronouns — produção e revisão","pron":"/h/ de house","verbs":["find"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["elderly","alone","act","bus stop","hello","older people","a warm hello","small act","lost senior","walk with","help line","neighbor’s door","town square","offer help"],"field":"Lazer","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 94 · Object pronouns: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Object pronouns — produção e revisão.","**Verbos:** find.","**Pronúncia:** /h/ de house.","**14 palavras novas** (lazer).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo escrever um editorial curto com pronomes objeto e find."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["elderly","idosos"],["alone","sozinho"],["act","ato"],["bus stop","ponto de ônibus"],["hello","olá"],["older people","older people"],["a warm hello","a warm hello"],["small act","small act"],["lost senior","lost senior"],["walk with","walk with"],["help line","help line"],["neighbor’s door","neighbor’s door"],["town square","town square"],["offer help","offer help"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Help the Elderly","paras":["Many older people live alone. We see **them** at the bus stop, and we don’t talk to **them**. A hello can help **them** feel good.","If you **find** an older person lost, ask **him** or **her**: “Can I help you?” and walk with **them**. A small act gives **us** all a better town."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Town Voice","gloss":[["elderly","idosos"],["alone","sozinho"],["lost","perdido"],["act","ato"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Many older people live alone.","ans":"T","why":"“live alone.”"},{"q":"The writer says: ignore them.","ans":"F","why":"talk to."},{"q":"A small act helps the town.","ans":"T","why":"last sentence."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“elderly” means…","opts":["idosos","jovens","crianças"],"ans":0,"why":"elderly."},{"q":"“alone” means…","opts":["sozinho","junto","perdido"],"ans":0,"why":"alone."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Object pronouns: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Frase","Exemplo"],"rows":[["verbo + pronome","**help them, ask her, tell us**"],["preposição + pronome","**with him, for me, to you**"],["frase em dois objetos","**Give me it.** → **Give it to me.**"]],"cap":"Object pronouns: production"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Com pronome, prefira **give it to me** a *give me it*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We see ___ at the bus stop. (they)","a":"them","why":"objeto."},{"s":"Can I help ___ ? (you)","a":"you","why":"objeto."},{"s":"Walk with ___ . (he)","a":"him","why":"objeto."},{"s":"If you ___ someone lost, ask. (find)","a":"find","why":"find."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["elderly","idosos"],["alone","sozinho"],["lost","perdido"],["act","ato"],["bus stop","ponto de ônibus"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["me","Walk","with"],"ans":"Walk with me","pt":"Caminhe comigo."},{"words":["I'm","lost","Yes"],"ans":"Yes I'm lost","pt":"Si